abstract: >-
  Public technical documentation for the Multiagentic Platform programme,
  including its inspected implementation boundaries, complementary
  relationship to VESPER inference research, and proposed validation protocol.
  The public Windows release 1.1.25 and its binary licence are recorded separately
  in GitHub Releases, with package verification distinct from historical inspection.
  This citation identifies the dossier, not a software binary version.
  Original development sources and training datasets are excluded; essential
  SPINS inference weights are included in the proprietary runtime distribution.
